{"timestamp": 1779342169.094273, "event_type": "body_reported", "tick": 11, "data": {"caller": "player_0", "reason": "Alice reported a dead body", "bodies": [{"room": "electrical", "victim_name": "Eve"}]}}
{"timestamp": 1779342169.095288, "event_type": "phase_changed", "tick": 11, "data": {"phase": "discussion"}}
{"timestamp": 1779342174.134475, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I reported Eve\u2019s body in Electrical. My route was Navigation \u2192 Security \u2192 Electrical. I hadn\u2019t seen anyone else this round before finding it, and I reported immediately. I don\u2019t have a suspect yet, but the body was definitely in Electrical."}}
{"timestamp": 1779342199.602634, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I was in Electrical early with Eve \u2014 she came in from Medbay side and was alive when I left. I went Electrical \u2192 Medbay \u2192 Upper Engine \u2192 Oxygen, and I was on O2 filter when the report happened. I didn\u2019t see Alice at all. If Alice found it coming from Security, then either someone came through Medbay/Cafeteria after I left, or it\u2019s possibly a self-report, but I don\u2019t have enough to hard accuse yet."}}
{"timestamp": 1779342210.5026062, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I don\u2019t have much direct info. My route was Cafeteria \u2192 Medbay \u2192 back through Cafeteria \u2192 Weapons, and I didn\u2019t see anyone at all, including Eve. I never went into Electrical, so I can\u2019t confirm the body location or timing.\n\nDiana saying Eve was alive in Electrical early is useful, and Alice says she found the body there from Security side. I don\u2019t think that\u2019s enough to call self-report yet. I\u2019d like to hear Bob and Charlie\u2019s routes, especially if either of them were near Electrical, Medbay, or Security. Right now I\u2019m not comfortable hard accusing anyone."}}
{"timestamp": 1779342236.909953, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I started upper engine, went to Oxygen, then back through upper engine to Medbay. I saw Charlie in Oxygen around ticks 2\u20133, and I saw him leave Oxygen toward upper engine at tick 4. I also saw Charlie again in upper engine around tick 6. I didn\u2019t see Diana, Alice, Frank, or Eve at all.\n\nSo from my info, Charlie was on the upper-left side with me early, away from Electrical at least until around tick 6. He could maybe still move later, but I didn\u2019t see him go toward Medbay/Electrical.\n\nThe main useful thing is Diana says she was in Electrical with Eve alive, then left through Medbay/Upper/O2. Alice says she found Eve in Electrical coming from Security. That puts the body between Diana leaving and Alice arriving, unless it\u2019s a self-report or Diana\u2019s timing/story is off. I\u2019d like to hear Charlie\u2019s route before deciding. Right now I\u2019m most focused on the Electrical/Medbay/Security area, so Alice and Diana are the key stories to compare."}}
{"timestamp": 1779342262.0084438, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "I was on the left side the whole round: Oxygen \u2192 Upper Engine \u2192 Lower Engine. I saw Bob in Oxygen around ticks 2, 3, and 4, then later I saw Bob leave Upper Engine toward Medbay at about tick 6.\n\nThat means Bob and I can kind of vouch for each other early, but after tick 6 Bob was heading toward Medbay, which is on the route toward Electrical. So he\u2019s not fully cleared for the kill timing if Eve died after Diana left.\n\nThe main people with possible opportunity seem like Alice, Diana, and maybe Bob after he went Medbay. Frank sounds pretty far away in Cafeteria/Weapons. I don\u2019t have a hard accusation, but I think the key is Electrical timing: Diana last saw Eve alive there, Alice found the body there, and Bob was moving toward Medbay afterward. I\u2019m not confident enough to force a vote unless others are, but those are the three I\u2019d be looking at."}}
{"timestamp": 1779342289.956722, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_0", "message": "I\u2019ll restate clearly: I came Navigation \u2192 Security \u2192 Electrical and found Eve\u2019s body in Electrical, reported immediately. I didn\u2019t see anyone on the way, so I can\u2019t hard clear or accuse from vision.\n\nAfter hearing everyone, I agree the key window is after Diana says she left Eve alive. Bob being seen heading toward Medbay around tick 6 means he could have reached Electrical later, so he\u2019s not fully clear. Diana also was the last known person with Eve, so she\u2019s not clear either. I know it looks like self-report is possible from your perspective, but I\u2019m goose and I reported as soon as I found it.\n\nRight now I\u2019m between Diana and Bob as the most possible based on routes, but I\u2019m not confident enough to hard push unless others feel stronger."}}
{"timestamp": 1779342309.86815, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_3", "message": "I agree the key window is right after I left Electrical. Eve was definitely alive when I left her there \u2014 I didn\u2019t report because there was no body yet, I just went Medbay \u2192 Upper Engine \u2192 Oxygen to do O2.\n\nWhat stands out to me now is Charlie placing Bob going toward Medbay after that. Medbay is directly connected to Electrical, so Bob had the route and timing to get there after I was gone. I also never crossed Alice, so her coming from Security could genuinely just be finding it from the other side.\n\nI\u2019m not hard-clearing Alice because self-report is always possible, but between Alice and Bob, Bob\u2019s timing feels more suspicious to me. I\u2019d be more comfortable voting Bob than guessing on Alice or skipping if people want a vote."}}
{"timestamp": 1779342328.962838, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_5", "message": "I\u2019m still in the same spot info-wise: I did Cafeteria \u2192 Medbay \u2192 Cafeteria \u2192 Weapons and didn\u2019t see anyone, so I can\u2019t clear or accuse directly.\n\nAfter hearing everyone, Bob/Charlie seem to partially confirm each other early on the left side, but Charlie saying Bob went toward Medbay around tick 6 is important because that gives Bob a possible path to Electrical after Diana left. Diana is last known with Eve alive, Alice is the reporter from Security side, and Bob had a route in from Medbay side.\n\nI don\u2019t think Alice self-report is impossible, but I don\u2019t have a reason to push that over the Medbay timing. If we vote, Bob is probably the most suspicious to me based on route and timing. If people aren\u2019t confident, skip is still reasonable, but I\u2019m leaning Bob more than Alice or Diana."}}
{"timestamp": 1779342359.328737, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_1", "message": "I get why my Medbay path looks bad, but I want to be clear: I never went into Electrical. My route was Upper Engine \u2192 Oxygen \u2192 Upper Engine \u2192 Medbay, and the report happened while I was in Medbay. I was there for my task, not passing through to Electrical.\n\nCharlie can confirm I was left side early, and he saw me only heading into Medbay around tick 6. That gives theoretical pathing, sure, but no one actually saw me in Electrical or near Eve. I also never saw Diana, Alice, Frank, or Eve at all.\n\nWhat bothers me is Diana says she went Electrical \u2192 Medbay \u2192 Upper Engine \u2192 Oxygen, but I was around Upper/Oxygen and didn\u2019t see her. Maybe timing missed, but she\u2019s the last person who says she saw Eve alive, and now she\u2019s pushing me mainly because I walked toward Medbay.\n\nI don\u2019t think there\u2019s enough to vote me here. If we\u2019re voting based on actual info, Diana and Alice are still the key Electrical people. I\u2019d rather skip than eject wrong, but if people force a vote, I think Diana is more suspicious than me."}}
{"timestamp": 1779342381.398695, "event_type": "discussion_message", "tick": 11, "data": {"player_id": "player_2", "message": "From my side, I can only hard confirm Bob was with me on the left early: I saw him in Oxygen ticks 2\u20134, then I saw him in Upper Engine around tick 6 leaving toward Medbay.\n\nThat doesn\u2019t put him in Electrical, but it does put him on the exact path to Electrical after Diana says she left Eve alive. Bob saying he was in Medbay when report happened actually still fits that window \u2014 Medbay is one step from the body.\n\nDiana being last with Eve alive is suspicious too, and Alice self-report is possible, but Bob\u2019s route is the one I can personally confirm lines up with the kill timing. I don\u2019t think Diana not being seen by Bob is a strong contradiction because timing could\u2019ve missed.\n\nI\u2019m leaning Bob here. If we skip, fine, but if we vote, Bob is my best suspect."}}
